    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"a real, quiet moment of release\" ... that's exactly what it feels like. like the noise is just too much. if everyone already treats me like i don't exist, then what's the point of even trying to fight for a life that isn't there anymore? it just seems so much more logical to just... stop the noise. to finally be at peace instead of this constant, miserable performance.",
